# Naming Conventions for Documents & IDs (Product Language)

- Order Number
- Invoice Number
- Payment Number / Reference
- Delivery Number
- Return Number
- Credit Note Number
- Ticket Number

Numbers are business identifiers used in search, support, and audit.

---

# Language Rules

1. Do not call an Order an Invoice.
2. Do not call a Message an Approval.
3. Do not call Analytics the balance due if Invoice Outstanding exists.
4. Do not call Suspended the same as Disconnected.
5. Do not call Available Inventory the same as On Hand.
6. Do not say “deleted” for financial history when the product actually voids/cancels/deactivates.

---

# Completion Criteria

All PDD documents use glossary terms consistently. New terms introduced by future expansion must be added here before implementation language spreads.

